WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:06,540
Why is there another typhoon?

2
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:09,440
Why hasn’t the company talked about it yet?

3
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:10,600
Notice of leaving work early

4
00:00:12,630 --> 00:00:13,630
Scared

5
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,040
The previous typhoons were just like that.

6
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,520
Heavy wind and rain

7
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:19,790
Unfortunately, I even stocked up on a box of instant noodles.

8
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:21,860
It took more than a month to finish eating

9
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:23,700
He is not a local

10
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:28,780
What kind of real typhoon will not move if you have never experienced it?

11
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:36,740
It would be better if there was no typhoon

12
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:47,940
I don't like typhoons

13
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:51,580
I can go to the vegetable market to accompany my parents after school, but a typhoon is coming.

14
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:56,020
They have to guard that seafood. Seafood is our family's destiny.

15
00:01:04,390 --> 00:01:05,870
It would be better if there was no typhoon
